WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,590 --> 00:00:06,580
If a tiger wants a squirrel, that's it

2
00:00:06,580 --> 00:00:08,380
It's true that the young master doesn't watch TV.

3
00:00:08,380 --> 00:00:09,700
I don’t care if he watches TV or not.

4
00:00:09,700 --> 00:00:10,980
Some people say it’s the devil squirrel

5
00:00:10,980 --> 00:00:16,760
No, you have to try Laofan

6
00:00:17,200 --> 00:00:19,160
Am I the first to find the blood-dropped squirrel?

7
00:00:19,320 --> 00:00:25,110
It was indeed the first one to be delivered.

8
00:00:25,630 --> 00:00:26,750
But the goods are wrong, right?

9
00:00:27,310 --> 00:00:29,770
What do you mean?

10
00:00:29,770 --> 00:00:31,410
Two days ago, news spread on the front lines

11
00:00:31,570 --> 00:00:36,810
Master Miao is not looking for the blood-dropping squirrel. It’s time to look for the devil squirrel. Why didn’t you tell me what else the devil squirrel is? I’ve never heard of it.

12
00:00:36,810 --> 00:00:37,770
I informed you

13
00:00:37,770 --> 00:00:41,800
The villagers around the three forest manufacturers have spread the word. You don’t know Lao Fan?

14
00:00:42,440 --> 00:00:43,760
Guess where my squirrel came from?

15
00:00:43,760 --> 00:00:44,740
I spend five hundred yuan

16
00:00:44,740 --> 00:00:50,020
This is what I got from Yiwen's experienced gauntlet, right?

17
00:00:50,260 --> 00:00:53,460
It's rare for a blood-dropped squirrel to sell you two hundred to me.

18
00:00:53,660 --> 00:00:56,140
What are you blocking? Twenty

19
00:00:56,260 --> 00:00:57,740
Two hundred dollars and I have to pay for my pants.

20
00:00:59,910 --> 00:01:02,310
I have to go do that devil squirrel trip too.

21
00:01:02,590 --> 00:01:03,990
Then remember to come tomorrow afternoon

22
00:01:03,990 --> 00:01:06,030
Because no one has heard of the devil squirrel

23
00:01:06,310 --> 00:01:08,950
There are too many people trying to cheat the bounty these days, so I made one

24
00:01:08,950 --> 00:01:10,150
Squirrel Fighting Contest

25
00:01:10,150 --> 00:01:12,310
Who wins the prize of 1,000?

26
00:01:12,310 --> 00:01:13,590
Who is the devil squirrel?

27
00:01:13,830 --> 00:01:20,380
Go do it now
